{"id":"n65571-6-6","stage":2,"title":"벗기다 · 打开","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65571-6-6-1","ko":"사탕 포장지를 벗기고 먹어야지.","zh":"得把糖果的包装纸撕掉才能吃啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사탕","meaning":"糖，糖果，糖块","explanation":"사탕：糖，糖果，糖块。","readings":[{"term":"사탕","audio":"/audio/fc8bc61c4689549766ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57306","senseId":"1","lemma":"사탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사탕","audio":"/audio/fc8bc61c4689549766ad.mp3"}},{"text":"포장지를","meaning":"包装纸","explanation":"포장지：包装纸；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"포장지","audio":"/audio/bb5bd83c764703192ba7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84694","senseId":"1","lemma":"포장지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"포장지를","audio":"/audio/17702e4415b45816633f.mp3"}},{"text":"벗기고","meaning":"打开，掀开，揭开","explanation":"벗기다：打开，掀开，揭开；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"벗기다","audio":"/audio/65ad7cd71a0b3f24de3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65571","senseId":"6","lemma":"벗기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벗기고","audio":"/audio/52f63721b72a135db60d.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어야지.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어야지","audio":"/audio/af5f92b91415026b52f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fc8bc61c46895497","term":"사탕","zh":"糖，糖果，糖块","audio":"/audio/fc8bc61c4689549766ad.mp3","entryId":"57306","definition":"用饴糖或白糖熬制成的硬而甜的点心，大小正适合入口。","pronunciation":["사탕"]},{"id":"bb5bd83c76470319","term":"포장지","zh":"包装纸","audio":"/audio/bb5bd83c764703192ba7.mp3","entryId":"84694","definition":"用于包裹东西的纸或塑料。","pronunciation":["포장지"]},{"id":"65ad7cd71a0b3f24","term":"벗기다","zh":"打开，掀开，揭开","audio":"/audio/65ad7cd71a0b3f24de3f.mp3","entryId":"65571","definition":"拿掉包着、盖着或遮着的东西。","pronunciation":["벋끼다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bf02531582f5f5c57ae1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65571-6-6-2","ko":"잘 안 돼요. 벗겨 주세요.","zh":"不行啊，麻烦帮我撕掉吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"做得成、顺利进行","explanation":"잘 안 돼요：不太顺利、弄不开。这里在说撕糖纸没成功，不是说不被允许。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}},{"text":"벗겨","meaning":"打开，掀开，揭开","explanation":"벗기다：打开，掀开，揭开；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"벗기다","audio":"/audio/65ad7cd71a0b3f24de3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65571","senseId":"6","lemma":"벗기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벗겨","audio":"/audio/70c1f0a9721aa75dddc1.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","